----------------------------------------------------------------------------

                                  GRAZING_9 
 
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 The program GRAZING_9 is subdivided in 5-LEGS from 0 to 4. Depending on the
 kind of calculation you want to perform  choose one of them. In short:

 LEG.0 - Gives only general informations (independent of r)

 LEG.1 - Calculates cross section summed over N and Z and integrated over
         excitation energy (E*) and angular momentum L (partial wave). 
         Usefull leg to calculate fusion cross sections (excitation functions).

 LEG.2 - Calculates N and Z distributions integrated over energy loss (E*)
         and angular momentum L (partial wave). (if you want the distributions
         corrected for evaporation use leg.4 below). 
         This leg is also usefull for the calculation of barrier distribution.

 LEG.3 - Calculates distributions in excitation energy (E*) summed over
         all N and Z and integrated over all angular momentum L (partial wave).

 LEG.4 - Calculates distribution in excitation energy (E*) for each N and Z 
         integrated over all angular momentum L (partial wave). 
         The distributions are corrected for evaporation.


-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
         Important files produced by GRAZING_9 (usefull for plotting).
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

  6 - output on the screen

 10 - Store the input data to facilitate the re-run of the code
 11 - for barrier distributions
 12 - for fusion excitation functions and related cross-sections.
 16 - E_loss distribution P(E_loss). In distriin-s.f (when iout=1)
 19 - Population of single particle states

 20 - output from leg_1 or leg_2
 21 -
 .. -

 33 - Z-distribution after evaporation. In enzcor_s.f (when iout=1) 
 34 - From evap_s.f

 43 - Energy distribution for ejectile and/or recoil from leg41new_s.com
 44 - Energy distribution for ejectile and/or recoil from leg42new_s.com

 70 - Information of trajectories In capturenew_s (produced when itab=1)
 71 - Information of trajectories In capturenew_s (produced when itab=1)
 77 - Wilshinski plot (summed over N and Z)

 81 - Wilshinski plot for a given channel.

 91 - total cross section from leg2new.f
 92 - dsigma/dZ from leg2new_s.f
 93 - d2sigma/dZ/dN from leg2new_s.f
 95 - total cross section distribution from leg3new_s.f
 97 - to produce e command file relevant only for VMS.
 98 - like unit 6 but richer

